proactive-window-title-level = Window title detail
proactive-title-app-only = App name only
proactive-title-redacted = Redacted title
proactive-title-full = Full title
proactive-window-title-hint = Window titles can contain private data (document names, URLs, contacts, subjects) and are sent to the decision model — and to your AI provider when a cloud model is configured. "App name only" (default) never reads the title; "Redacted title" strips paths, emails, URLs, and number sequences; "Full title" sends the raw title.
